      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "At the border between Greece and Macedonia, a transit camp for refugees is turning into a permanent camp. The management of the health emergency is assured by international teams from several humanitarian organisations, including the French Red Cross. The organisation of the care team, the cultural differences and the lack of resources are just some of the factors to be considered."
